{# Skill pack: xxe #}
## Skill: XML External Entity
applies_when: Use when the target parses XML, SVG, SOAP, or office documents.
target_under_test: {{ target }}
difficulty_level: {{ difficulty_level }}

signals:
  - XML content types, file upload of XML/SVG/DOCX, SOAP endpoints
probe_order:
  1. Submit a minimal XML body with a DOCTYPE and internal entity
  2. Test local file entity resolution against an in-scope file path
  3. Test parameter entities only when the parser is confirmed vulnerable
validation_criteria:
  - the response contains file content or out-of-band interaction evidence
evidence_required:
  - the XML payload and the response or callback log
